WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,980
young man

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:06,700
I've already ordered three dishes and one soup for you, okay? Oh my God, I'll go.

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,420
How long has it been?

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,740
You have moved more than half of the way, sir.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,820
It's so straightforward for you to ask me, Brother Xiao, to do something.

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,300
Look how awesome I am, Brother Xiao

7
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,700
Is this young man so strong?

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,620
Isn't that right?

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,500
Brother Xiao, this is how he always works. Let me move this up.

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,290
I'll go have dinner later, young man.

11
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:24,970
Are you so strong? It's okay. Come on. Come on.

12
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,890
Let's go have a meal first after the young man comes back.

13
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,720
I've already paid the money

14
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,680
Eat whatever you want

15
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,280
After eating, you guys need to take a rest before moving. Don’t be in a hurry.

16
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:34,640
at your speed

17
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,240
It should be completed around three o'clock

18
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,680
I'll come find you later

19
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:45,640
How can this person be so good at eating? Brother Xiao, he’s full

20
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:48,040
You have such a good appetite. Let's continue working.

21
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,520
Finish moving those things early, why don't you take a break?

22
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,920
I feel like my calves are still shaking.

23
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,400
If you're tired, why don't you take a break and I'll move it first?

24
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,080
Didn’t I take advantage? Let’s go.
